postText:
#ursulaPH
#communicationisAID
#proudtoberettPH🇵🇭

Situation Update in Aklan as of 251000H Dec 19 due to TYPHOON URSULA:

Caticlan to Kalibo is not passable due to landslides along Nabas highway;

Kalibo to Iloilo is also not passable due to flooding along 
Altavas - Dumarao  - Mambusao area;

-Communications and electricity in Aklan is backdown;

-No reported casualty ad of now;

-Storm Signal # 3 is still hoisted in Aklan/ Boracay.

For info, Sir. 12IB, Philippine Army
